    <string name="bot_bastion_title">Bot Bastion</string>
    <string name="bot_bastion_help_title">How to play Bot Bastion</string>
    <string name="bot_bastion_help_text">Rock-ships called Drifters fly along the glowing lanes toward your Core. Tap an empty node to build a bot there. Pickets shoot all round, Lobbers lob big splash shots from far away but cannot hit what is beside them, Hazes have huge reach and low power, and Tenders slow and freeze ships. Skiffs patrol the edge of the arena. Tap a bot to upgrade it, change its target or sell it. Aegis adds a shield to the Core. Waves get bigger and tougher, and every tenth wave has a boss. Pause any time: you can still build while paused. If you play with friends, choose who is acting with the player chips and drag on the arena to steer their pilot ship.</string>
